  "prefLabel": "En 702.09 Sewage disposal service",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 702.09 \"Sewage disposal service\" means the collection, transportation, treatment, and disposal of sewage including but not limited to the active processing of sewage to remove impurities and its ultimate discharge in the environment. This definition does not include septic pumping.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
